+// copy has no inputs, so it is loop-invariant: define it once at the end of the idom of the innermost loop header,
+// which dominates every block of the loop, and rename every other copy of that immediate in the loop to it.
+// GPR only, never vector-source components, and at most IMM_HOIST_MAX immediates per loop: each hoisted value is
+// live across the whole loop, so an unbounded hoist would trade movs for spills. v2: only blocks that dominate every
+// latch — v1 hoisted the relooper's per-state constants too (loop_continue_simd 43 -> 51 GPR, 40 -> 36 warps).
+// NVMTL_NAK_NOIMMHOIST=1 is the same-binary negative control (the per-iteration mov must come back).
