+/* G-SUB (b79): the channels a pending signal can name. A signal recorded as (slot, gen, seq) has completed once that
+ * channel's semaphore reaches seq, or once the slot's generation moved on (a channel is idled before it is
+ * unregistered). Every field but the semaphore memory is guarded by nvkmd_nvrm_gsub_mtx. */
